<!--
  A P+R on the map — the same plate, widened to carry "P+R".

  Its own marker rather than a colour variant of the garage one, because the
  difference is the whole reason to show any of this: P+R Sloterdijk is
  "1,00 per 24u" against EUR 8,05 an hour on a Centrum street. Shape and label
  carry that; hue cannot, because every hue in this palette already means
  something else.

  Same near-black (ZoneCandidate) and same keyline as ic_marker_garage, and
  mode-independent for the same reason: the tiles under it do not follow the
  app theme.

  23x15dp, per the v0.7.5 mockup.
-->
